  "notes": [
    "No individual stars meeting the eligibility criteria are identified. The paper proposes a Roman survey of the Andromeda halo and discusses stellar populations, clusters, streams, and high-velocity stars generically, but it does not identify any specific star as a Galactic unbound candidate, nor does it perform follow-up on any named Galactic unbound candidate."
